{
"file": 872,
"paths": [
"d008/d086/f018"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "194ee684",
"en_raw": "Someone's there..."
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "c703a40d",
"en_raw": "...That is called synchronicity"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "91374351",
"en_raw": "or"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "e8e821d2",
"en_raw": "also, 'synchronicity'"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "eb64e4b4",
"en_raw": "as they say"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "7cc8cfb2",
"en_raw": "By the way, may I ask"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "7812a942",
"en_raw": "what are you kids doing"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "b4fd02e2",
"en_raw": "in a dark place full of mosquitoes"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "a747e50f",
"en_raw": "like this?"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "e2567c1d",
"en_raw": "Um, well, that's..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "cd4c6f4f",
"en_raw": "(...Nao!)"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "7f55377d",
"en_raw": "We, um..."
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "db827262",
"en_raw": "Well..."
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "e0e1f868",
"en_raw": "just came to collect insects..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "9b66c473",
"en_raw": "Insect collecting, I see"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "04fa0906",
"en_raw": "It's about that season, is it?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "151879a4",
"en_raw": "How about it, are there still"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "61cf4659",
"en_raw": "various bugs in Hirumi?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "99a3089e",
"en_raw": "...So-so"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "e126d009",
"en_raw": "I see"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "6d6e94b2",
"en_raw": "But when catching bugs"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "5cb80cf0",
"en_raw": "there's, you know"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "837e8d75",
"en_raw": "a butterfly net"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "e4fe4767",
"en_raw": "and then, so as not to injure"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "8327e1e8",
"en_raw": "bug wings with fingers, tweezers"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "50c14bdf",
"en_raw": "these are essentials"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "06664ca1",
"en_raw": "...I'll be careful from now on"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "050e0b3b",
"en_raw": "If you catch a good one"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "5829af77",
"en_raw": "let me know"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "be520226",
"en_raw": "Oh, we meet again"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "c83a5ce8",
"en_raw": "Summer vacation homework"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "689cd4fe",
"en_raw": "seems quite tough"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "c72e3224",
"en_raw": "But, say"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "e76daa7e",
"en_raw": "it's still"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "76037cf1",
"en_raw": "a bit early for summer vacation, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "9be7ead6",
"en_raw": "Eh, ah, well..."
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "db827262",
"en_raw": "Well..."
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "7aa61c11",
"en_raw": "I want to collect"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "3f096572",
"en_raw": "as many bugs as possible..."
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "a089a164",
"en_raw": "Quite enthusiastic"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "5165bc7e",
"en_raw": "Well then, if you catch a good one"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "9a210f73",
"en_raw": "...the far reaches of Tokyo"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "50d747fb",
"en_raw": "hidden in Hirumi City"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "89358de5",
"en_raw": "the mystery of buried treasure..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "e14f5d6b",
"en_raw": "A wonderful rumor that tickles"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "6bd34f8f",
"en_raw": "a middle schooler's spirit of adventure, no?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "46d364c1",
"en_raw": "And yet"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "dfd0a12b",
"en_raw": "I'm terribly sorry to say"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "bf3379d1",
"en_raw": "this rumor, actually..."
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "52f7ee22",
"en_raw": "...What?"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "25c3d2b7",
"en_raw": "Yes, yes"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "b1ea6a90",
"en_raw": "Very well"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "255f3d56",
"en_raw": "Let me say it outright"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "6532a2bd",
"en_raw": "You see, this rumor"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "3a7f5571",
"en_raw": "I spread it myself"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "84e174ce",
"en_raw": "showing a neighborhood kid my handwritten map"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "1e848d2a",
"en_raw": "saying treasure's buried in the forest"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "0194ff64",
"en_raw": "Yes, in other words"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "cb7076c6",
"en_raw": "it's what's called a hoax"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "a33f174c",
"en_raw": "No way!"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "47faef21",
"en_raw": "that middle schoolers are taking it seriously"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "bfcbc2e5",
"en_raw": "I thought, come on"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "408db20e",
"en_raw": "they can't be that simple"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "eff8455d",
"en_raw": "Um, then"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "9b14b9ad",
"en_raw": "why are you here, mister?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "4fc19056",
"en_raw": "My wife"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "4a49c68d",
"en_raw": "appeals to my"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "22af2055",
"en_raw": "conscience"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "51d8898d",
"en_raw": "with persuasion, you see"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "4c283068",
"en_raw": "Well, in short..."
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "97eb94d9",
"en_raw": "if someone else's child"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "eb152243",
"en_raw": "got lost in the forest, she said"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "d5aeab53",
"en_raw": "so she made me put up a 'closed today' sign"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "7d308fb4",
"en_raw": "and sent me here"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "7064adf3",
"en_raw": "Um, sorry to ask"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "a2e72847",
"en_raw": "but if such a rumor goes around school"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "c907fd77",
"en_raw": "tell them it's a hoax"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "30f9a836",
"en_raw": "could you?"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "1e937b6a",
"en_raw": "I doubt it, but"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "32374de6",
"en_raw": "just in case..."
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "87a87ff6",
"en_raw": "...Y-yes, I will"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "5cde091a",
"en_raw": "Well, then, that's that"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "39686a34",
"en_raw": "It was a hoax..."
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "6f179741",
"en_raw": "Ah, wait a moment"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "fd776379",
"en_raw": "Just one request..."
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "e7baca99",
"en_raw": "Honestly"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "e9ddb3c9",
"en_raw": "Don't give me a scare"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "aeb8049e",
"en_raw": "That guy is way too suspicious"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "e93080cd",
"en_raw": "...Who on earth is he?"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "ef96e33f",
"en_raw": "(A bird...)"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "a3e0f91a",
"en_raw": "(That startled me...)"
}
]
}